  "APIProfile":           "Basic",
  "Description":          "Text and Speech Translation. Acquires or accepts Input Speech, or accepts Input Text, translates into the language named by the Language Selector, and produces Output Text and Output Speech. Acquisition and delivery are inside the Composite AIM: an empty Speech Object on Input Speech means acquire from the device, while omitting the port leaves the speech branch idle. Realised entirely by its Topology, so it has no binary of its own.",

